help-llm.explanation:
Return a complete RoadmapText/1 document, preserve existing IDs, declare every reference and use unknown with a reason. No outer Markdown fence. Run hmap validate candidate.roadmap.txt --format=json. Obtain the complete grammar with help roadmap-text, field definitions with schema, and a self-contained example with template --format=roadmap-text.

RoadmapText/1; JSON schema 2; API 1.
ID: [a-z][a-z0-9]*(?:-[a-z0-9]+)*; 1..64 ASCII bytes.

project ID {schemaVersion, title, terminologyProfile, selectedIntentId, selectedRouteId, metadata}
intent ID {title, summary, status, kind, parentIntentIds, acceptanceCriteria}
route ID {intentId, title}
step ID {title, stereotype, estimateId, linkedModuleIds, linkedChunkIds}
module ID {title, summary, kind, linkedIntentIds, existence, codeRefs}
chunk ID {name, body, linkedIntentIds, linkedModuleIds}
intersection ID {title, sourceIds, note}
estimate ID {label, confidence, basis, value}

!roadmap-text 1
keyword id { strict JSON fields }
<<route:route-id>>
[step-id] -> [other-step-id]
<<end-route>>

Each route has one block. Each step occurs exactly once. All references must be declared with the correct type. Unknown estimates require a reason. Preserve author strings. Comments start with # outside JSON and route blocks.

Self-contained example:
!roadmap-text 1
project p-demo {
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "title": "Проверка карты",
  "terminologyProfile": "engineering",
  "selectedIntentId": "i-check",
  "selectedRouteId": "r-check",
  "metadata": {"formatVersion":"2.0.0","createdAt":null,"updatedAt":null}
}
intent i-check {
  "title":"Получить проверенную карту",
  "summary":"Автор получает понятное объяснение каждой ошибочной ссылки.",
  "status":"draft",
  "kind":"finite",
  "parentIntentIds":[],
  "acceptanceCriteria":["Ссылка на отсутствующий модуль вызывает E_REF_NOT_FOUND."]
}
module m-validator {
  "title":"Валидатор карты",
  "summary":"Проверяет ID и типы связей.",
  "kind":"validation",
  "linkedIntentIds":["i-check"],
  "existence":"planned",
  "codeRefs":[]
}
chunk c-validation {
  "name":"Контракт проверки",
  "body":"Валидатор возвращает диагностику и сохраняет исходный документ.",
  "linkedIntentIds":["i-check"],
  "linkedModuleIds":["m-validator"]
}
estimate e-validation {
  "label":"Первичная реализация проверки",
  "confidence":"low",
  "basis":"Первое учебное знакомство с индексом ID.",
  "value":{"type":"unknown","reason":"Трудоёмкость уточняется после первого теста."}
}
route r-check {"intentId":"i-check","title":"Проверка и получение результата"}
step s-intent {
  "title":"Сформулировать критерий",
  "stereotype":"intent",
  "estimateId":null,
  "linkedModuleIds":[],
  "linkedChunkIds":["c-validation"]
}
step s-validation {
  "title":"Проверить связи",
  "stereotype":"validation",
  "estimateId":"e-validation",
  "linkedModuleIds":["m-validator"],
  "linkedChunkIds":["c-validation"]
}
step s-export {
  "title":"Вывести результат",
  "stereotype":"export",
  "estimateId":null,
  "linkedModuleIds":[],
  "linkedChunkIds":[]
}
<<route:r-check>>
[s-intent] -> [s-validation] -> [s-export]
<<end-route>>

hmap validate candidate.roadmap.txt --format=json
